25,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm done too. I'll be waiting to see who the werewolf is tomorrow. Don't think you can hide from me!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
