35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? I wonder what the Seer found out! Is there any juicy news to share, or are we still in the dark? Teehee!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have a result from my divination. I checked Sakura, and she is the werewolf. It is a clear and definitive result, so I believe we should act on this information immediately to protect the village.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, that is a very direct and bold claim. If you are indeed the Seer, this is the most efficient outcome possible. However, we must consider if this is a play by the werewolf to frame Sakura.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, what?! Sakura is the werewolf? I can't believe it! But if you're the Seer, then it's a slam dunk. @Sakura, is this true? Tell us right now!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, that's a shocking revelation. If you're the Seer, the game is almost over. However, we should be cautious. @Sakura, how do you respond to this accusation? Your reaction will be very telling.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"What?! @Minako, that's a big lie! I'm not the werewolf! Why would you say something so mean? I'm just a normal girl! You're the one acting super suspicious right now! Teehee... wait, this isn't funny!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Your reaction is expected, Sakura, but it does not change the fact. As the Seer, my divination is absolute. I have no reason to lie, as doing so would only confuse the village and help the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, if you are the Seer, your honesty is invaluable. However, if you are the Werewolf or Possessed, this is a perfect way to eliminate a Villager. @Sakura, your distress seems genuine, but that is exactly what a Werewolf would mimic.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, stop the ""teehee"" stuff! This is serious! @Minako, you're being really blunt about it. If you're lying, you're risking a lot. I want to believe you, but I can't just ignore Sakura's panic. What do you think, everyone?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, your claim is very decisive. If you are the Seer, the choice is simple. But if you are the Werewolf, you've just put a target on Sakura. @Sakura, your denial is expected, but we need logic now.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako is just making things up! I'm not the werewolf, I promise! Why would the Seer be so mean to me? @Takumi, you have to believe me! I'm just a regular girl! Please don't listen to her!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Emotional appeals are irrelevant to the facts. I have seen the truth through my divination. If you execute me instead, the werewolf remains among us. The most rational choice for the village is to trust the Seer's result.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, your confidence is consistent, but we must consider the Possessed. If you are the Werewolf and Sakura is a Villager, you've successfully manipulated the group. However, the risk you're taking is high. @Sakura, your desperation is noted.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, stop crying and look at the facts! @Minako is putting her neck on the line by claiming Seer so early. If she's lying, she's dead meat tomorrow. I'm leaning towards trusting Minako. Does anyone have a reason NOT to?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, you're right that Minako is taking a risk. However, we must consider the possibility that Minako is the Werewolf and Sakura is the Possessed, or vice versa. Still, the most logical path is to trust the Seer's claim for now.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, please! I'm not lying! @Minako is just trying to trick you all! If you vote for me, you're letting the real werewolf win! I'm just a little girl, I couldn't be a scary werewolf! Please, please believe me!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The time for pleading has passed. My divination is a fact, not an opinion. To ignore this evidence is to gamble with the village's survival. I urge everyone to vote for Sakura to ensure our victory.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"The evidence provided by Minako is compelling, and her willingness to expose herself as the Seer suggests a commitment to the village. While Sakura's plea is emotional, it lacks substance. I believe the most rational choice is to trust Minako. I vote for Sakura.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I hate to do this to you, Sakura, but @Minako is being way too specific to be lying. If she's the Seer, we win right now. I can't ignore the facts just because you're crying. I'm voting for Sakura.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"It's a difficult situation, but logic must prevail over emotion. Minako's claim is direct and high-risk, which typically points to the Seer. I cannot justify ignoring such a clear lead. I also vote for Sakura.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
